      "message": "test(bore): pin the centre-cutting law on the milled Bore's way in\n\nThe Bore ride rides the planar ladder, whose every descent asks the\ncentre-cutting law (M11.3, 874507a8 / 515525c4): a cutter that is not\ncentre-cutting ramps into an undrilled hole along the radial sweep, or\nthe op is refused by name where no ramp or helix fits; it never plunges\ninto solid. Three app tests pin it, and the centre-cutting cutter's\naxial plunge as the audit's control.\n\nRefs #1036\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
